miex (src/mie_routines.f90: subroutines aa2 and shexqnn2)
    The Mie routine of miex, S. Wolf & N. V. Voshchinnikov, 2004, Computer
    Physics Communications 162, 113 (CPC Program Library ADUD_v1_0). It is
    distributed under the CPC Non-Profit Use Licence
    (https://www.elsevier.com/about/policies-and-standards/open-access-licenses/elsevier-user/cpc):
    academic and non-profit use only, no commercial use, no redistribution to
    third parties without the written permission of the authors. It is included
    in DMS with the written permission of S. Wolf (November 2026). DMS 2.0
    allocates its work array with the number of terms needed and removed its
    saved variables (for OpenMP); the algorithm is unchanged. If you use DMS,
    please cite Wolf & Voshchinnikov (2004).

Optical data (data/optical_constants/)
    The optical constants come from the publications listed in
    data/optical_constants/README.md; please cite them when you use them.
    The files in data/optical_constants/optool/ are taken from optool and are
    distributed under its MIT licence (data/optical_constants/optool/LICENSE_optool.txt).
